            <div xml:id="d47-a1">

                <pb facs="0188" n="70" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg70"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No.
                    1—Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bocayuva to Mr. Valente.</hi></head>
                <p>Republic proclaimed. Provisional Government constituted by the army, navy, and
                    people enter upon its duties. Chief of the Government, Marshall Deodoro da
                    Fonseca; minister of interior, Aristides Silveira Lobo; finance, Ruy Barbosa;
                    war, Lieutenant-Colonel Benjamin Constant Botelho Magathoes; navy. Rear-Admiral
                    Eduardo Wandenkolk; foreign affairs, Quintino Bocayuva; justice, Manuel Ferros
                    Campos Salles; agriculture, Demetrio Ribeiro.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Quintino Bocayuva</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister of Foreign Affairs.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
